# 换行符统一规则
# 文本文件：仓库内存 LF，检出到工作区也是 LF
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows 批处理：仓库内、工作区、raw 下载三处都必须是 CRLF
# 注意不要写成 "text eol=crlf"：那只是检出时转成 CRLF，
# blob 里存的仍是 LF，在 GitHub 上单独下载某个 .bat 就会得到 LF 文件
*.bat -text
*.cmd -text

# 二进制文件：不做换行转换，也不参与文本 diff
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ico binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.png binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.bmp binary
*.zip binary
*.7z binary
*.rar binary
*.gz binary
*.tar binary
*.exe binary
*.dll binary
*.pdf binary
*.xlsx binary
*.docx binary
